        "Emgage Foundation demonstrates a high level of fiscal discipline, as evidenced by its <cite id=\"7\">96.46 score for Accountability & Finance</cite> from Charity Navigator. This is supported by a <cite id=\"7\">93.3% program expense ratio</cite> in recent filings, which is rare for advocacy-based nonprofits. Furthermore, the organization has successfully <cite id=\"8\">distributed $920,000 in domestic grants</cite> to 33 recipients, including groups like <cite id=\"8\">OCA-Greater Houston and Every Voice TX</cite>, to amplify its civic engagement reach across the United States."
