      "summary": "The Emgage Foundation is a national, non-partisan organization dedicated to <cite id=\"8\">mobilizing Muslim American voters</cite> through civic education and leadership development. The organization operates a <cite id=\"7\">Million Muslim Votes Campaign</cite> and extensive Get Out The Vote (GOTV) programming to ensure community representation in the democratic process. In FY2024, the foundation reported <cite id=\"8\">$4,069,674 in total revenue</cite>, representing a <cite id=\"8\">17% decline from the previous fiscal year</cite>. Despite this recent revenue dip, the organization maintains a <cite id=\"7\">97/100 overall score from Charity Navigator</cite>, reflecting high standards of accountability. Their model focuses on <cite id=\"7\">systemic change</cite> rather than direct service, aiming to empower the community through <cite id=\"3\">voter registration drives</cite> and legislative meetings. The foundation reported serving <cite id=\"7\">over 1 million beneficiaries</cite> through its various outreach and advocacy efforts. While it holds a <cite id=\"7\">Platinum Seal of Transparency from Candid</cite>, its alignment for traditional religious donors is balanced by its focus on secular advocacy rather than direct humanitarian relief.",
